   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DCED Trust Fund 070481 Medlemsskap juli 2012 - jun 2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DCED Trust Fund 070481 Membership fee July 2012 - June 2015 - DCED Trust Fund 070481</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det DCED &#xe4;r ett forum d&#xe4;r ett 25-tal bilateral-, multilaterala och    andra bist&#xe5;ndsakt&#xf6;rer samlas f&#xf6;r att utbyta erfarenheter och f&#xf6;r att  utveckla en gemensam syn p&#xe5; god praxis. Utvecklingen av metoder       bygger ffa p&#xe5; empirisk erfarenhet: dvs vad har fungerat och vad har   inte fungerat i de olika landkontexterna.                              Sida har varit medlem i DCED sedan 2004.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DCED is a forum where member agencies and others can come         together to share experiences and to formulate a common understanding of good practice. This understanding is based particularly on         empirical experience in the field: what has worked, and what has not.  Sida has been member to DCED since 2004</narrative>
  </description>
